    <!--
        `colorScheme.surface` from lib/theme.dart — see docs/design-tokens.md.

        This is the window behind the Flutter UI, shown in the gap between the
        splash going away and the first frame being painted. It used to be
        `?android:colorBackground`, the platform default (near-white in light,
        black in dark), so the launch ended on a flash of a colour that is in
        no palette. Keep it equal to the splash background.
    -->
    <color name="window_background">#F9FAEF</color>
	<color name="ic_launcher_background">#F9FAEF</color>
